Tab Statistics [Drain]
Statistics is described under the tab Statistics. In addition to the statistical data described under the
Statistics Report, the Drain collects and shows the statistical data of the mobile objects.
Remarks
You can also select to collect statistics for MUs with the same name that pass through your simulation
model, compare the tab Type Statistics.
Each time the Drain removes a part from the plant, it computes the proportional average value of each
statistical value displayed. For this it divides the average value by the average lifetime times 100.
To view Cumulated Statistics of the Parts which the Drain Removed From the Plant in the Statistics
Report, select View > Show Statistics Report in the dialog of the object. You can also click the right
mouse button in the Frame and select Show Statistics Report or you can press F6.
See also
Tab Statistics [material flow objects]
Tab Type Statistics
Statistics Report [described]
Product Statistics of the MUs [general description]
Resource Statistics [check box]
Resource Type
Tab Statistics [Drain]
