Detailed Statistics Table [Drain]
The Detailed Statistics Table itemizes the MUs, which the Drain removed from the plant, according to
their types. To open the Detailed Statistics Table, click this button.
Remarks
The Detailed Statistics Table shows these values:
Item Description Read-only Attribute
Type Shows the name of the MU. —
Time Shows the last arrival of part of this type. —
Total
throughput
Shows the number of parts of this type. StatThroughputPerDay
[SimTalk] - Drain
StatThroughputPerHour
[SimTalk] - Drain
%Parts Shows the percentage of parts of this type. —
LT_Mean Shows the mean life time (throughput time) of all
investigated parts.
—
LT_StdDev Shows the standard deviation of the life times of all
investigated parts.
—
LT_Min Shows the minimum life time of the investigated
parts.
—
LT_Max Shows the maximum life time of the investigated
parts.
—
TPh_Mean Shows the number of MUs that the Drain removed
from the plant in an hour over all observed times
during which the Drain was available.
—
TPh_StdDev Shows the standard deviation of the throughput per
hour.
—
TPh_Min Shows the minimum throughput per hour. —
TPh_Max Shows the maximum throughput per hour. —
TPd_Mean Shows the number of MUs that the Drain removed
from the plant in a day over all observed times
during which the Drain was available. This is the
value of the throughput per hour multiplied with 24.
